# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# WireZTNA Web UI — Environment Variables
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# IMPORTANT: In most cases, you do NOT need a .env file.
#
# Browser-facing API requests always use same-origin /api paths. Vite proxies
# them to the local control plane in development; nginx does so in production.
#
# Do NOT set VITE_API_URL. A compile-time API origin can expose the internal
# control-plane port and cause mixed-content or CORS failures.
